    "body": "## Summary\n\nFinal commit of ADR-044. Marks the ADR as Implemented **with an honest visual-delta caveat** — the first ADR this session to close with a \"not screenshot-verified\" status rather than a PNG-confirmed delta.\n\n## The honest accounting\n\nADR-044's Context section predicted \"4+ first-viewport changes\" based on rule-count. **Actual visual delta**: at 2px radius on 100px+ elements, the rounding is below the unambiguous-perception threshold at 1920px screenshot resolution.\n\n| Aspect | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Parse path | Verified — 11 unit tests |\n| Paint branch (`any_radius` gate) | Verified — triggers for radius > 0.001 |\n| Zero-radius regression-free | Verified — byte-identical to pre-ADR-044 |\n| Title underline (ADR-042) preserved | Verified |\n| Toolbar line (ADR-043) preserved | Verified |\n| Issue box border (ADR-040) preserved | Verified |\n| **2px rounding humanly perceptible in PNG** | Not verified |\n\n## Why this differs from ADR-042 / ADR-043\n\n| ADR | Visual delta | Verification status |\n|---|---|---|\n| ADR-042 | Title underline | PNG-verified (unambiguous 1px line) |\n| ADR-043 | Toolbar line | PNG-verified (unambiguous 1px line) |\n| ADR-044 | 2px rounded corners | Subtle, not screenshot-verifiable |\n| ADR-041 Commit 2 | (skipped) | — no visible delta predicted |\n\nADR-044 is closest to ADR-041's Commit 2 shape but **shipped rather than skipped** because parse is correct, paint is correct, larger radii will render visibly, and zero-radius is regression-free. **Behaviorally complete.**\n\n## Docs updated\n\n- ADR-044 -> Implemented with caveat embedded in Implementation section\n- ADR-040: Post-ADR-044 note (search field + issue box = border + radius)\n- ADR-043: Post-ADR-044 note (rounded box-shadow deferred)\n- README row 044 with caveat\n- CHANGELOG entry with caveat\n\n## Test count\n\n- 562 cases / 2188 assertions all pass\n- Documentation only; no code changes\n\nRefs #215\n",
